  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING: FHIR R4 standardization of appointment/encounter status enums. AppointmentStatusEnum rebuilt to the FHIR AppointmentStatus value set (PROPOSED, PENDING, BOOKED, ARRIVED, CHECKED_IN, FULFILLED, CANCELLED, NO_SHOW, WAITLIST, ENTERED_IN_ERROR) and MedicalEncounterStatusEnum to the FHIR EncounterStatus value set (PLANNED, ARRIVED, TRIAGED, IN_PROGRESS, ON_LEAVE, FINISHED, CANCELLED, ENTERED_IN_ERROR, UNKNOWN). Enum members and numeric values changed; status codes persisted by earlier versions are not compatible.",
